<SNAP stateVersion="2" order="shift,press,space,drive" name="sparks scatter sideways" tags="Bright,Tight,Hi-Hat,Percussion" description="bright, tight, wide hats for fast rolls: a tiny stereo detune spreads them, a short top-only room adds space, air lifts the shine and the tails stay short.">
